Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:11.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a first ever WTA Tour title for Harriet Dart.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达特首夺巡回赛单打冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:13.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's been really hard.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一路真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:17.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And, you know, I've wanted it so much, so badly, sometimes too much.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我太想做到 有时甚至想得太多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:20.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But to finally be here, and be in the final means the world.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N终于打进决赛 对我意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:24.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So thank you, and thank you to my team for sticking with me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢一直陪着我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:26.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I really appreciate you guys.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我真的很感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:27.88,TL,,0,0,0,,这是夺冠前一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.36,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛后的采访 那时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:33.09,TL,,0,0,0,,她还不知道自己会成为冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:35.95,TL,,0,0,0,,仅仅是第一次打进巡回赛单打决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.95,0:00:39.40,TL,,0,0,0,,就已经让{\fs78}30{\fs68}岁的达特 等了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.11,0:00:42.11,TL,,0,0,0,,哈丽雅特 达特出生在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.11,0:00:43.95,TL,,0,0,0,,伦敦汉普斯特德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.95,0:00:45.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}岁时 她在家附近的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.81,0:00:49.23,TL,,0,0,0,,坎伯兰草地网球俱乐部开始打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:51.63,TL,,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈也在那里相识
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:52.92,TL,,0,0,0,,她的网球故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:55.50,TL,,0,0,0,,有一个很生活化的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:01:01.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I loved playing tennis as a child because it was so social, I made so many friends growing up.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N小时候打网球 能交很多朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:05.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And I still have loads of friends from back then now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很多儿时球友 至今仍是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:10.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I played at the Cumberland Lawn Tennis Club, which is my local club.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我在当地的坎伯兰俱乐部打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:12.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And actually my parents met there, so it's quite a special place.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我父母在那里相识 那里很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:15.51,TL,,0,0,0,,她在采访里说 大约{\fs78}13{\fs68}岁时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:18.24,TL,,0,0,0,,开始认真想做职业球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:20.70,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2011{\fs68}年 她出战职业赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:21.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2014{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.88,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到第一座低级别职业赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.48,TL,,0,0,0,,次年 第一次站上巡回赛单打正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:32.48,TL,,0,0,0,,可是 往上走的日子 并不连续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:34.04,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2015{\fs68}年的脚伤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:36.11,TL,,0,0,0,,让她休战了大约半年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:38.94,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年 髋部又受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:41.74,TL,,0,0,0,,对一名还在建立职业生涯的球员来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:44.37,TL,,0,0,0,,她需要先重新回到球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:46.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.55,0:01:49.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}22{\fs68}岁的达特连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}场资格赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:50.83,TL,,0,0,0,,终于走进正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:53.56,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是她欣赏多年的莎拉波娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:55.98,TL,,0,0,0,,她第一次来到澳网正赛的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:58.00,TL,,0,0,0,,却是两个{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:09.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match, Sharapova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 莎拉波娃获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:13.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two sets to love, six-love, six-love.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N直落两盘 两个六比零
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.85,TL,,0,0,0,,第二年 她又从澳网资格赛打起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:20.60,TL,,0,0,0,,这次 首轮打了将近{\fs78}3{\fs68}个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:22.29,TL,,0,0,0,,她逆转土居美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.46,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到澳网正赛首胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:26.43,TL,,0,0,0,,一年前一局未得的球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:28.81,TL,,0,0,0,,她终于带走了一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:30.76,TL,,0,0,0,,更大的突破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:33.65,TL,,0,0,0,,等到{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年的印第安维尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:35.30,TL,,0,0,0,,又是从资格赛出发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.04,TL,,0,0,0,,她先后击败斯维托丽娜和卡内皮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:39.55,TL,,0,0,0,,打到第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:41.83,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}月{\fs78}21{\fs68}日 {\fs78}25{\fs68}岁的达特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.83,0:02:43.96,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次进入单打世界前{\fs78}100{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.96,TL,,0,0,0,,排名第{\fs78}99{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.05,TL,,0,0,0,,那时她接受采访
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.05,0:02:50.13,TL,,0,0,0,,说自己过去常因一场失利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:52.53,TL,,0,0,0,,难受好几个星期 后来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.30,TL,,0,0,0,,她学着把眼光放回每天的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.40,TL,,0,0,0,,一直努力却等不到结果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:03:00.17,TL,,0,0,0,,已经是她非常熟悉的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:03.74,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年 变化继续发生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:05.21,TL,,0,0,0,,一月 她在堪培拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:08.35,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}125{\fs68}级赛事拿到单打亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:09.90,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月 在克卢日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:13.08,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次收获巡回赛单打四强成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:16.58,TL,,0,0,0,,她越来越接近决赛 但还没有到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:18.69,TL,,0,0,0,,同年温网第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:21.59,TL,,0,0,0,,她和博尔特打到决胜盘抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:24.48,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后 离输球越来越近
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:26.20,TL,,0,0,0,,可达特把比分追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:28.63,TL,,0,0,0,,最后以{\fs78}10{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68}赢下抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:31.61,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她第二次打进温网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match, Dart.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 达特获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:45.38,TL,,0,0,0,,赢球后 她蹲在草地上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:47.13,TL,,0,0,0,,把手捂在嘴边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:47.99,TL,,0,0,0,,那个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:51.27,TL,,0,0,0,,她的单打排名最高来到世界第{\fs78}70{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:53.58,TL,,0,0,0,,你会在大满贯集锦里看见她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.75,TL,,0,0,0,,却还不能在巡回赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:57.66,TL,,0,0,0,,名单里找到她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:00.70,TL,,0,0,0,,她的经历里 也有争议
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:02.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年鲁昂站
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:05.72,TL,,0,0,0,,她对布瓦松说了涉及体味的不当言论
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:07.51,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后 她公开道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:10.29,TL,,0,0,0,,说自己对那番话感到后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:12.37,TL,,0,0,0,,到了{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:14.07,TL,,0,0,0,,她已经和拉姆斯登一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.77,TL,,0,0,0,,在诺丁汉和布拉格拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:17.77,TL,,0,0,0,,巡回赛双打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.89,TL,,0,0,0,,所以广州这次 准确地说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:22.36,TL,,0,0,0,,是她的巡回赛单打首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.86,TL,,0,0,0,,这座奖盘 她一直等到{\fs78}30{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:30.22,TL,,0,0,0,,来到广州时 她的单打排名是{\fs78}115{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:31.85,TL,,0,0,0,,还要先打资格赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.85,0:04:33.47,TL,,0,0,0,,第一场就先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:36.89,TL,,0,0,0,,随后靠抢七追平 再赢下决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:39.50,TL,,0,0,0,,从冠军倒着看 那只是第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:43.32,TL,,0,0,0,,身处其中 她先要争取一张正赛门票
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:47.43,TL,,0,0,0,,正赛首轮 {\fs78}3{\fs68}盘 第二轮 {\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:50.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛对巴多萨 还是{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:53.68,TL,,0,0,0,,等她站上决赛 已经连赢{\fs78}6{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:55.82,TL,,0,0,0,,对她来说 这一周的难度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:59.69,TL,,0,0,0,,藏在每一场都要重新开始的决胜盘里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.21,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:04.25,TL,,0,0,0,,她面对{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁的中国姑娘孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:06.83,TL,,0,0,0,,先输{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} 第二盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.55,TL,,0,0,0,,又轮到自己发球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:12.02,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然两次在平分后占先 拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:14.14,TL,,0,0,0,,达特先后救回两个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:16.92,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分 是其中的第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.56,TL,,0,0,0,,之后 她抢七{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}扳回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:35.62,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 终于赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:38.62,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 她没有停在决赛门外
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:42.47,TL,,0,0,0,,她赛后流泪 感谢团队一直陪伴自己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:59.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's a massive moment in the career of Harriet Dart, who is into her first tour-level final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达特首次晋级巡回赛单打决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:08.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she does so in pretty dramatic circumstances as well. She saves a couple of match points{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她晋级之前 还救回两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:15.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in the second set there to get the better of this potential superstar, the 16-year-old Sun Xinran.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘逃生 击败新星孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.17,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对面的塔格尔只有{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:20.80,TL,,0,0,0,,已经拿过巡回赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:23.75,TL,,0,0,0,,达特{\fs78}30{\fs68}岁 第一次打这样的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.75,0:06:26.88,TL,,0,0,0,,先输{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 再以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}追回
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.56,TL,,0,0,0,,她又一次 要在第三盘里争取结果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:33.91,TL,,0,0,0,,算上资格赛 这一周她打了{\fs78}7{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:35.95,TL,,0,0,0,,其中{\fs78}6{\fs68}场要打{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:38.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}场正赛 无一例外都是{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:40.67,TL,,0,0,0,,加起来{\fs78}20{\fs68}盘球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:42.21,TL,,0,0,0,,她把自己留在比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:45.97,TL,,0,0,0,,也终于把这场等待 带到了冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:50.34,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 达特发球 {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:52.60,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她的第三个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:55.39,TL,,0,0,0,,先把前两个没兑现的机会放下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:57.80,TL,,0,0,0,,再发一球 再接一次来球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:00.60,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 终于轮到她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:15.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a first ever WTA Tour title for Harriet Dart.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达特首夺巡回赛单打冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:24.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a moment for the 30-year-old, who has had to work so hard this week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三十岁的她 这一周拼尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:28.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six of her seven matches have gone the distance.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N七场比赛 有六场打满三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:32.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But Dart hits the bullseye in Guangzhou.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达特终于在广州 命中靶心！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:42.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Been playing some great tennis in the last few months, and she gets her reward.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N几个月的出色表现 结出果实
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:44.70,TL,,0,0,0,,从小时候交朋友的俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:47.82,TL,,0,0,0,,到{\fs78}30{\fs68}岁亲吻这只冠军奖盘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.11,TL,,0,0,0,,达特的路 有伤病 失利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:52.36,TL,,0,0,0,,也有过需要道歉的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:53.24,TL,,0,0,0,,而今天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.13,TL,,0,0,0,,她终于完成了单打的一次突破
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:57.69,TL,,0,0,0,,如果结果来得很慢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.69,0:08:00.10,TL,,0,0,0,,你还愿意给自己多少时间？
